/**
 * @file http3_proxy_connection
 * @brief Bounded HTTP/3 server-side inspection connection.
 *
 * This adapter owns the protocol glue which every HTTP/3 inspection service
 * otherwise has to repeat: SETTINGS and control streams, dynamic QPACK
 * unblock/acknowledgement, request assembly, semantic HTTP policy, origin
 * request/response association, response framing, and WebTransport routing.
 * The QUIC/TLS provider, origin transport, policy, and observer are injected.
 *
 * @copyright Copyright (c) 2022 NT Template Library Authors.
 */
